# Pairs with RetainedRestorable. The compensation restores a depended-on
# manifest's row but leaves the manifest in the pass's plan, so the pass goes
# on to delete the base it has just found an increment built on.
MODULE: RetainedRestorableRestoreContinuesDeleting
TARGET: RetainedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a restored manifest stays doomed and is deleted anyway
PERTURBS: RestoreRow

--- FIND
    /\ prBlocked' = [prBlocked EXCEPT ![p] = @ \ {m}]
    /\ prDoomed' = [prDoomed EXCEPT ![p] = @ \ {m}]
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] =
         IF prBlocked[p] = {m} THEN Settle(p, prDoomed[p] \ {m}) ELSE "restore"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ prBlocked' = [prBlocked EXCEPT ![p] = @ \ {m}]
    \* MUTATION: the restored manifest stays in the plan.
    /\ prDoomed' = prDoomed
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] =
         IF prBlocked[p] = {m} THEN Settle(p, prDoomed[p]) ELSE "restore"]
--- END